[[2047,96,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The power socket / cigarette lighter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsupplied (at pin 2) by the line controlled by the ignition (INT/A)\nfor the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected by the fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are\nhoused in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pin 3 of socket\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              is earthed.</p><p>The ring nut for the power socket is lit\nup (at pin 1) when the side lights are on by means of the line coming\nfrom the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               switch and is protected\nby the controls illumination fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Rear power point\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P52</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              is supplied\n(at pin 2) by ignition-operated line (INT/A) protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nsupplementary fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 C.</strong></p><p>Pin 3 of socket \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P52</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                                is earthed.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>(the ring nut for the rear current\nsocket is not lit up).</p></aside>"]]